---
import { categories } from '@/data/categories';
---

<footer class="mt-16 py-10" style="border-top:4px solid #15120E">
  <div class="content-width">
    <p class="mb-6 text-xs font-bold leading-relaxed" style="border:2px solid #15120E;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;gap:8px">
      <span style="background:#15120E;color:#FFD21F;padding:0 5px;font-weight:900">AD</span>
      <span>휙은 쿠팡 파트너스 활동의 일환으로, 이에 따른 일정액의 수수료를 제공받습니다.</span>
    </p>
    <nav class="mb-6" aria-label="카테고리 링크">
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5">
        {categories.map((cat) => (
          <li><a href={cat.path} class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-sub)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">{cat.name}</a></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} 휙 hwick.shop</p>
  </div>
</footer>
